<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Yeremi firin nde</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi firin nde Annabi Yeremi bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Yeremi firin nde</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ye</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi firin nde Annabi Yeremi bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Yeremi naxa kitaabui firin sɛbɛ. Keren xili “Ala xa masenyi Annabi Yeremi bɛ.” Boore xili, “Ala xa masenyi firin nde Annabi Yeremi bɛ.” E xa masenyi maniya. E sɛbɛ waxati, Isirayila yaxuie nu na nɔfe Yudaya nun a xa mangɛ taa Darisalamu ra. Alatala yati nu bara na ragiri e xa yunubie xa fe ra. Na ɲaxankatɛ nu xɔrɔxɔ a gbe ra barima a nu fatanxi Ala xa xɔnɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kui won nɔma sɛriyɛ saxan tode. A singe, yunubi mu rafan Ala ma. Ala to sɛniyɛnxi, a mu nɔma lande sɛniyɛntareɲa ma. Fo adama xa a fahaamu a yunubi raɲaaxu Ala ma, barima a mu findixi a yuge sɛniyɛnxi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">A firin nde, Ala yunubi sare ragbilenma nɛ yunubitɔɛ ma. Ala to tinxinxi, a mu nɔma a lude yunubitɔɛ mu a xa fe ɲaaxi sare sɔtɔ. Alatala xa tinxinyi a niyama nɛ mixi xa e yunubi sare sɔtɔ. Ala mu nɔma gbilende na tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">A saxan nde, Ala wama yunubitɔɛ rakisife. Ala to mixi xanuxi, a fe birin nabama nɛ alako a xa adama matinxin, a xa a xa yunubie xafari, a xa a rakisi a xa xanunteya saabui ra. Yi masenyi, naxan toma Annabi Yeremi xa sɛbɛli tagi (Sora 3:21-32), a sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa won mali na sɛriyɛ birin fahaamude. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi firin nde Annabi Yeremi bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa ɲɔnyi bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="sp">Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Munse Darisalamu sɔtɔxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Singe mixi nu wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">kɔnɔ yakɔsi e mu wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">A bara lu alɔ kaaɲɛ ginɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Singe a xili nu xungbo ɲamanɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">a findi mangɛ taa nan na e ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">kɔnɔ yakɔsi a na konyiya kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Kɔɛ birin a wafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">a yaye nu a xɛrɛe maxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">A xanuntenyie mu na sɔnɔn naxee a madunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">A booree birin bara a yanfa, e findi a yaxuie ra.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />E bara Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xanin konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">e a rayaagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Yakɔsi a dɔxɔxi sie tagi, malabui yo mu na a bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">A yaxuie a tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Mixi yo mu na Siyon kirae xɔn ma sɔnɔn, sigafe salide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Siyon xa naadɛe birin bara kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">a xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe tɔɔrɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">a xa ginɛdimɛdie sunnunfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Siyon na fe xɔnɛ nan kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />A yaxuie bara nɔ a ra, e fa lu bɔɲɛsa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Alatala na ragirixi, Siyon xa fe ɲaaxie nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">A gerefae bara a xa die xanin konyiya kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Siyon sɛnbɛ birin bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">A xa kuntigie bara lu alɔ xeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">naxee mu ɲooge toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">naxee bara tagan koyinma ya ra.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Darisalamu xa yaagi nun a xa kui ifui kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">a bara a maɲɔxun a xa se fanyie birin xa fe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">naxee nu na a yi ra tɛmui dangixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">A xa ɲama to sa a gerefae bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">a malima yo mu nu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">A yaxuie naxa yele a xa kasarɛ ma.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Darisalamu xa yunubi bara gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">a bara findi sɛniyɛntare ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Naxee birin nu a matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">e na yofe a ma yakɔsi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">A bara lu alɔ mixi mageli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">a yaagi, a fa a yɛtɛ nɔxun.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Nɔxɔɛ nu na a xa dugi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">kɔnɔ a mu a maɲɔxun a xa fe raɲɔnyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Kasarɛ naxan a masɔtɔ, a magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Mixi yo mu na, naxan a madunduma.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="LAM 1:9">Siyon xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">«Alatala, n ma marayaagi mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">barima n yaxuie bara xunnakeli sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />A yaxuie bara a xa se fanyi birin tongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">A si gbɛtɛe to nɛ so ra a xa salide kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">naxee mu daxa e xa so naa.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />A xa ɲama birin bara kɔntɔfili baloe fende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">E bara e xa naafuli birin masara donse ra, alako e xa balo.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="LAM 1:11">Siyon xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">«Alatala, n ma yaagi mato.<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />Ala xa dangi mixi ratanga na fe mɔɔli ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Wo a mato xa n ma tɔɔrɛ maniyɛ na fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Alatala naxan dɔxɔxi n ma a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />A bara tɛ ragoro kelife koore, naxan bara n fate gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">A bara gantanyi ti n bɛ, a yɛlɛ itala n santide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">A bara n nabira bɔxi, a n halakixi lu naa.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />A bara n ma yunubie sare sa n kɔn ma alɔ karafoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">A bara n sɛnbɛ xun nakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Alatala bara n sa n yaxuie bɛlɛxɛ, naxee sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />A bara n ma geresoe birin matutun, naxee nu na n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">A bara n yaxuie maxili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">alako e xa n ma fonikee sɛnbɛ kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Alatala bara Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa di halaki a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />N na wafe yi tɔɔrɛ nan ma, n yaye raminima e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Naxan n madunduma, a gbilen limaniya fi ra n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Na bara makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">N ma die bara halaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">barima yaxui sɛnbɛ nu gbo n bɛ.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Siyon bara a bɛlɛxɛe itala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">kɔnɔ mixi yo mu na naxan a madunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Alatala bara yaamari fi Yaxuba dɔxɔbooree xa findi a gerefae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Darisalamu bara findi sɛniyɛntare ra e tagi.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />Alatala xa maragiri tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">barima n bara a xa yaamarie matandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Wo tan si birin, wo wo tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">wo xa n ma tɔɔrɛ mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">N ma ginɛdimɛdie nun n ma fonike xɛmɛe birin bara xanin konyiya kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />N bara n xanuntenyie xili, kɔnɔ e bara n yanfa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">N ma sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun n ma forie bara faxa taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">E faxi donse fende naxan nɔma sɛnbɛ di fide e ma.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Alatala, n ma tɔɔrɛ mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">N bɔɲɛ mu rafanxi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">barima n a kolon n mɛɛ nɛ i xa sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">n findi matandila yati nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Santidɛgɛma mixi sɔntɔ taa fari ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">fure ɲaaxi mixi faxama taa kui.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Mixie bara n wa xui mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">kɔnɔ mixi yo mu na naxan n madunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">N yaxuie birin bara n ma tɔɔrɛ xa fe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">e bara ɲɛlɛxin i bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">I bara fa lɔxɔɛ ra, i lɔxɔɛ naxan ma fe fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">A niya n yaxuie fan xa lu alɔ n tan.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />I xa e xa ɲaaxuɲa birin mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">I xa a niya e fan na alɔ i a niyaxi n na ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">n ma fe kobi rabaxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">N ma kɔntɔfili wuya, n bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔxi a gbe ra.»<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa kanɛ</para>
  <para style="sp">Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Alatala xa xɔnɛ bara a niya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">kuye xa ifɔɔrɔ Darisalamu xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">A bara barakɛ ba Isirayila ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">A to xɔnɔ, a naxa Isirayila rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">a nu ɲɛrɛma ɲama naxan ya ma.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />Marigi mu kinikini e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">A bara Yaxuba xa banxi birin kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">a bara Yudaya taa makantaxie rabira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">a e xa mangɛya masara yaagi ra a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />A to xɔnɔ e ma, a bara Isirayila sɛnbɛ birin kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">E yaxuie to nu e ixɛtɛnfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Ala bara tondi Isirayila malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Na xunnakanɛ bara lu alɔ tɛ soxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">a Yaxuba xa bɔxi birin gan.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />A bara a xa xali suxu won xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">alɔ won yaxui a rabama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">A bara won bɔnbɔ sɛnbɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">alɔ a findi won gerefa nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">A bara won ma mixi birin faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">won nu ɲɛlɛxinma naxee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">A xa xɔnɛ bara lu alɔ tɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">naxan bara so Darisalamu hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Alatala bara lu alɔ won yaxui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">A bara Isirayila nun a xa banxi fanyie birin kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">A bara a xa yire makantaxie rabira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">A bara Yudaya xa kinikini nun sunnunyi xunmasa.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />A bara a sɛnbɛ ramini na ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">a a xa mixie malande kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">Alatala bara a niya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">sali xungbe nun malabui lɔxɔɛ sali xa nɛɛmu Siyon na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">A bara mangɛ nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ rayaagi a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />Alatala bara makuya a xa sɛrɛxɛbade ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">a mɛɛ a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">A bara Siyon banxi fanyie sa won yaxui bɛlɛxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Won yaxuie bara gere sɔnxɔɛ rate Alatala xa banxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Na xui nu gbo alɔ xui naxan itema sali lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />Alatala nan a ɲanige a xa Siyon tɛtɛ rabira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">A mu siikɛ a rabafe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">A bara tɛtɛ fari nun a bunyi birin nabira.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />A bara taa naadɛe rabira bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">e balandee birin bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Mangɛe nun kuntigie bara xanin ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Sɛriyɛ rabatufe mu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">xɛɛraya fan mu na namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Siyon forie dɔxɔxi bɔxi, e dɛ bara bobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">e bara xube maso e xunyie ma sunnunyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">e bara sunnun donmae ragoro e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Darisalamu ginɛdimɛdie bara e xun sin bɔxi.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />N yaye bara mini han, n bɔɲɛ bara n tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">n sondonyi bara sunnun n ma ɲama xa gbaloe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Dimɛe nun diyɔrɛe na faxafe taa kui.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Dimɛe a falama e ngae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">«Donse nun minse sɔtɔma minden?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">E nu siga tuxunsan na alɔ mixi maxɔnɔxie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">e bira taa kui kirae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">e ɲɛngi bolon e ngae bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />N fa munse falama i bɛ kɔrɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Siyon, i maniyɛ mu na n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">N i madunduma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">I xa ɲaxankatɛ bara gbo dangi baa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Nde nɔma i rayalande?<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />I xa namiɲɔnmɛe bara wule laamatunyie masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">e mu i xa yunubi fiixɛ i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">alako i naxa fa lu konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">E bara wo madaxu wule laamatunyie ra.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Dangi mixi birin e bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔma i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">e kolinma, e e xunyie malintanma Darisalamu xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">E a falama, «Singe yi taa tofanyi maniyɛ mu nu na duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">kɔnɔ yakɔsi go?»<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />I yaxuie birin na wo mafalafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">e kolinma, e e ɲinyie maxinma wo xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">e nu a fala, «Won bara e xun nakana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">alɔ won nu wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">Na bara sɔɔnɛya won bɛ.»<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />Alatala naxan ɲanige, a na nan nabaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">A bara a xa wɔyɛnyi rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">a naxan masen tɛmui xɔnnakuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">A bara kanari raba, a mu kinikini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">A bara a niya i yaxuie xa i mayele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">A bara i gerefae sɛnbɛ ragbo yɛ.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Mixie na wafe Marigi ra e bɔɲɛ birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Siyon ɲama, yaye ramini alɔ xure.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">I naxa i malabu, i xa wa tun.<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Keli, sɔnxɔɛ rate kɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">I bɔɲɛ rayensen yɛ alɔ ye, Marigi ya tode ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">I bɛlɛxɛ ti a bɛ i xa die xa simaya xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">barima e na halakife kaamɛ ra tunxunyie birin na.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Alatala, i ya ti i bara yi niya naxee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">A lan ginɛe xa e xa die don, e naxee bari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">A lan sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa faxa Marigi xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Fonikee nun xɛmɔxie, e birin lantanxi bɔxi ma taa tunxunyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">N ma ginɛdimɛdie nun n ma sɛgɛtalae, santidɛgɛma bara e birin faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">I bara faxɛ ti i xɔnɔ lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">I bara e kɔn naxaba, I mu kinikini.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />I bara n yaxuie malan n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">alɔ mixie malanma ki naxɛ sali lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Alatala xɔnɔ lɔxɔɛ, mixi yo mu lu, mixi fan mu a imini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">N naxee xanu, n naxee ramɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">n yaxuie bara e birin faxa.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Tɔɔrɛ nun Ala xa marafanyi</para>
  <para style="sp">Annabi Yeremi xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Mixi nan n na, naxan bara tɔɔrɛ kolon Ala xa xɔnɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />A bara n tongo kuye iyalanxi, a n naɲɛrɛ dimi kui.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />A n tɔɔrɔma lɔxɔɛ birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:3">Danyi yo mu na n ma tɔɔrɛ ma<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />A bara n naxɔsi kelife n xunyi ma sa dɔxɔfe n sanyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:4">A bara n xɔrie birin magira.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />A bara n tɔɔrɔ, a n nabilin ɲaxankatɛ ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />A bara n lu dimi kui alɔ singe ra mixi faxaxie.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />A bara n nabilin sansanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:7">a yɔlɔnxɔnyi sa n ma, alako n naxa fa mini.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />N bara gbelegbele, n bara xili ti dɛmɛri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:8">kɔnɔ a bara naadɛ balan n ma maxandi ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />A bara kira balan n ya ra gɛmɛ belebelee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:9">a n ti tɔɔrɛ kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />A bara lu alɔ sube xaaɲɛ naxan n mamɛfe burunyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:10">alɔ yɛtɛ naxan a nɔxunxi n ya ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />A bara duniɲa ixutu n ma, a bara n kana.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />A bara a xa xali itala a a xa tanbɛe ti n na.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />A to a xa tanbɛe bɛɲin, e naxa n bɔɲɛ sɔxɔ.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />N bara findi n ma mixi birin ma mayele se ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:14">lɔxɔɛ birin, e n findima e xa sigie ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />A bara n naluga ɲooge xɔnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:15">a bara xɔnɛ findi n ma donse ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />A bara a niya n xa gɛmɛ xɔrie maxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:16">han n ɲinyie birin bara magira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:16">A bara n maboron xube xɔɔra.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />A bara bɔɲɛsa makuya n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:17">han fe fanyi mɔɔli birin bara nɛɛmu n na.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Na nan a toxi n bara a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:18">«N ma fe bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:18">Alatala bara n kuma se birin na n xaxili nu tixi naxee ra.»<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />N bara n maɲɔxun n ma marayaagi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:19">n bara n maɲɔxun n ma simaya naxasixi ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />N mu nɔma nɛɛmude n ma tɔɔrɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:20">A xun bara masa han a bara gɛ n kuntinde.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Kɔnɔ na birin kui, n nan n xaxili tima fe naxan na, a tan nan ya:<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />Alatala xa hinnɛ mu ɲɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:22">danyi yo mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />A gbilenma a ra gɛɛsɛgɛ yo gɛɛsɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:23">«Alatala, i mu mɛɛma i xa mixie ra abadan!»<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />N a kolon n bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:24">Alatala nan na n harige ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:24">N xaxili tixi a tan nan na.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />Alatala fe fanyi rabama a fenma bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:25">naxan xaxili tixi a ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Mixi lan a xa sabari Alatala ya i naxan fama a rakiside.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />A lanma adama xa tɔɔrɛ kolon a fonike tɛmui.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />A xa dundu, a xa dɔxɔ a xati ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:28">barima Alatala nan a ragirixi a ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />A xa a xun sin bɔxi, tɛmunde Ala fama nɛ a xa dubɛ suxude.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />A xa a xɛrɛ ti mixi bɛ, naxan a ragarinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:30">a xa tin na yaagi ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Marigi mu mixi ratutunma abadan.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />A na mixi nde tɔɔrɔ, a man fama nɛ hinnɛde a ra a xa fonisireya kui.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />A waxɔnfe xa mu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:33">a xa mixi rayaagi, a xa ibunadama tɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Mixi na geelimanie tɔɔrɔ a ɲaaxi ra bɔxi kui,<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />e na tinxintareya raba mixi ra Ala Xungbe ya i,<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />e na mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛ a makiiti tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:36">Alatala mu a birin toma xɛ?<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Nde nɔma fe ra, xa Ala xa mu a ragirixi?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Fe fanyi nun fe ɲaaxi, a birin mu kelima Ala Xungbe xui xa ma?<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Munfe ra ibunadama a mawama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:39">xa a tɔɔrɛ sɔtɔ a yɛtɛ xa yunubi saabui ra?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Won xa won ɲɛrɛ ki mato, won xa a igbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:40">won xa gbilen Alatala ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Won xa Ala maxandi won bɔɲɛ birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:41">won xa won bɛlɛxɛ ite Ala bɛ naxan na koore ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ɲama xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />«Muxu xa yunubi nun matandi bara gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:42">i fan mu diɲɛxi muxu ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />I xa bɔɲɛ xɔnɛ bara lu muxu fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:43">i bara faxɛ ti, i mu kinikini.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />I bara nuxui ti won tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:44">alako muxu xa maxandi naxa i li.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />I bara muxu findi suuti ra ɲamanɛe tagi.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />Muxu yaxuie birin bara e dɛ ibi muxu xili ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />Gaaxui nun bɔɲɛ mini bara nɔ muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:47">muxu xa fe findixi kanari nun gbaloe nan tun na.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />N ya suusama yaye ra, n ma mixie xa gbaloe xa fe ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />Danyi yo mu na n wafe ma, malabui yo mu na n bɛ,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />han beenun Alatala xa a ya ragoro won ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />N bara kinikini ginɛdimɛdie xa tɔɔrɛ ma.»<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Annabi Yeremi xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Mixie bara n keri alɔ xɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:52">hali n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />E bara n nagoro kɔlɔnyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:53">e nu fa gɛmɛe ragoro n ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Ye to din n xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:54">n naxa a fala, «N bara lɔɛ!»<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />N naxa i tan Alatala xili kɔlɔnyi gbaata ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />I fan naxa n xui mɛ n to a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:56">«I naxa tondi n xui ramɛde. Yandi, n mali.»<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />N to i maxandi, i naxa i maso n na, i a fala n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:57">«I naxa gaaxu.»<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Alatala, i bara n ma fe suxu, i bara n nii rakisi.<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Alatala, i a toxi e fe naxee niyaxi n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:59">I xa n ma nɔndi makɛnɛn.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />I bara a to e kɔnkɔxi n ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:60">e yanfanteya naxan birin xirima n xun ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Alatala, i bara e xui mɛ konbi ti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:61">e yanfanteya naxan birin xirima n xun ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />N gerefae xa wɔyɛnyi nun e xa maɲɔxunyi na n tan nan fɔxɔ ra lɔxɔɛ birin.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />A mato, xa e dɔxɔxi, xa e tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:63">e n tan nan findixi e xa sigie ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />Alatala, i xa n gbeɲɔxɔ e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:64">E naxan niyaxi n na, i xa na ragbilen e ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />I xa e xaxili dɔnxu, i e danka, barakatareɲa xa bira e fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Alatala, i xa bɔɲɛ xɔnɛ xa lu e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:66">i xa e ba duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu ɲama xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Xɛɛma mu yilenma sɔnɔn, a mu sɛniyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">Gɛmɛ tofanyie bara ralantan yɛ taa tunxunyie birin na.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Siyon die tide nu gbo alɔ xɛɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">kɔnɔ yakɔsi e tide bara xurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">alɔ fɛɲɛe naxee yailanxi bɛndɛ ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Hali wulabare ginɛ xiɲɛ fima a xa die ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">kɔnɔ n ma ɲama bara lu alɔ dingɛ naxee mu mixiɲa rakamalixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">E kobi alɔ sɛgɛ.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Kaamɛ bara a niya, diyɔrɛ nɛnyi bara kankan a naxare.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">Dimɛe taami maxɔrinma, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu e kima.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Naxee nu donse fanyi donma, kaamɛ bara e rabira taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">Naxee ramɔxi fe fanyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">e fa na ɲooge nan yegelenfe e bɛlɛxɛe ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />N ma ɲama xa ɲaxankatɛ bara gbo dangife Sodomakae gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">naxee halaki ya magirɛ keren kui, mixi keren bɛlɛxɛ mu din e ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />E xa mangɛdie nu tofan dangi xɛɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">e nu fiixɛ dangi xiɲɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">E fate rayabu alɔ ye xɔɔra sinbonyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">e yatagi nu luxi nɛ alɔ diyaman.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi e fate bara fɔɔrɔ dangi tige ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">e mu kolonma taa kui sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">E kiri fatuxi e xɔrie ma, a bara xara alɔ bole.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Naxee faxa santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">e tan nan xun nu rafan dangi mixi birin na kaamɛ naxee ɲaxankatafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">Kaamɛtɔɛe bara xɔsi, e taganxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">e mu donse yo sɔtɔma kɔrɛ.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Dingɛe, marafanyi nu na naxee bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">e bara e yɛtɛ xa die ɲin, e e don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">alako e xa balo alibalawi kui.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />Alatala xa xɔnɛ bara kamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">A bara a ralantan yɛ, a tɛ xuru Siyon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">naxan bara yire tixie birin gan.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Bɔxi mangɛe mu la a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">duniɲa mixie sese fan mu la a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">xa yaxuie nɔma sode Darisalamu naadɛe ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Yi gbaloe kelixi a xa namiɲɔnmɛe xa yunubie nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">a nun a xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa fe kobi rabaxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">e tan naxee tinxintɔɛe nii baxi.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi e ɲɛrɛma taa kui alɔ dɔnxuie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">mixi yo mu a bɛlɛxɛ dinma e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">barima wuli naxan goroma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">a bara e findi sɛniyɛntaree ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Mixie luma gbelegbele ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">«Wo keli be! Wo tan mixi sɛniyɛntaree!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Wo keli be, wo keli be! Wo wo makuya muxu ra!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Na kui e naxa e gi sigafe ra ɲamanɛe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Naakae fan bara a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">«E mu luma muxu xɔnyi kɔrɛ!»<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />Alatala yɛtɛ yati nan e rayensen yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">a mu fa a ɲɔxɔ saxi e xɔn ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">A bara binyɛ ba sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">xunnakeli mu na forie bɛ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Muxu bara mali nde mamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">kɔnɔ mixi yo mu fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">Muxu bara muxu ya ti kira ra han muxu ya bara rafɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">kɔnɔ si yo mu fa muxu ratangade.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Muxu yaxuie nu muxu ɲɛrɛ ki birin toxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">alako muxu naxa fa mini taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">Muxu xa fe danyi nu bara makɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">lɔxɔɛ gbegbe mu nu luxi muxu bɛ sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">barima muxu xa fe danyi nu bara gɛ a lide.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Muxu kerimae nu xulun dangi sɛgɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">naxee na koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">E naxa muxu keri han geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">e e nɔxun muxu ya ra, e muxu mamɛ burunyi.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />E naxa muxu rakisima fan suxu, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">Won nu bara a fala a xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">«Muxu yiriwama nɛ a niini bun ma ɲamanɛe tagi.»<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />I tan Edon ɲama naxan sabatixi Usu bɔxi ma ɲɛlɛxin yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">yakɔsi i na sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">kɔnɔ i fan xa kiiti waxati na fafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">I fama nɛ ɲaxankatɛ nun yaagi sɔtɔde.<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Siyon ɲama, a gbe mu luxi i xa ɲaxankatɛ xa dan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Ala mu i xa konyiya rabuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">kɔnɔ i tan Edon ɲama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Alatala fama nɛ i makiitide i xa yunubie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">a xa i ɲaxankata nee xa fe ra.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɲama ɲaxankataxi xa sali</para>
  <para style="sp">Ɲama xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Alatala, muxu xa tɔɔrɛ mato, muxu xa yaagi igbɛ!<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Xɔɲɛe bara muxu kɛ tongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">Mixie bara sabati muxu xa banxie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">muxu kolonmae mu naxee ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Muxu bara findi misikiinɛ babataree ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:3">muxu ngae bara lu alɔ kaaɲɛ ginɛe.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Muxu mu nɔma muxu xa ye minde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">fo muxu xa a sara kɔbiri ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">Muxu mu nɔma muxu xa yege fan gande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">fo muxu xa a sara.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Muxu ɲaxankatamae dɔxɔxi muxu fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">Muxu bara tagan, malabui yo mu na.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Muxu bara muxu bɛlɛxɛ itala Misira nun Asiriya biri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">alako e xa muxu ki taami ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Muxu babae bara yunubi raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">kɔnɔ e mu na duniɲa sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">Muxu tan nan fa e xa fe kobie tɔruɲɔɛ xaninfe.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Konyie nan fa tixi muxu xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:8">mixi yo mu na naxan muxu bama e yi ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Muxu baloe fenma wula i gaaxui kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">barima santidɛgɛma kanyie na yire birin.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Kaamɛ bara muxu suxu.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Muxu yaxuie bara e waxɔnfe raba Siyon nun Yudaya ginɛdimɛdie ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />E bara kuntigie gbaku wurie ma, e binyɛ ba forie yi.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Fonikee mɛngi dinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">e yege maxanin han yege kote bara bira e ma.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Forie bara ba e malanfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:14">fonikee fan bara ba ɲaxaɲaxafe.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Muxu bɔɲɛe bara ba sɛɛwafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:15">muxu xa xulunyi bara masara sunnunyi ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Xunnakeli bara ba muxu yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:16">muxu bara makinikini muxu xa yunubie xa fe ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Na nan a toxi, muxu bɔɲɛe tɔɔrɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">muxu ya fan bara rafɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Siyon geya bara findi gbengberenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">a bara findi xulumasee maɲɛrɛde ra.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Kɔnɔ i tan, Marigi Alatala, i tan nan mangɛ ra tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">Danyi mu na i xa mangɛya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">keli lanfanmae ma, sa dɔxɔ lanfanmae birin na.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Munfe ra, i fa nɛɛmuxi muxu ma yi mɔɔli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">ka i muxu rabɛɲinma nɛ muxu xa simaya birin kui?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Alatala, muxu ragbilen i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">muxu xa fa i ma alɔ a singe.<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />I mɛɛxi nɛ muxu ra kerenyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:22">I xɔnɔma nɛ muxu ma abadan?<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>